#: aboutbugreportingdialog.cpp:30
msgctxt "@title title of the dialog"
msgid "About Bug Reporting"
msgstr "Över Fehlerberichten"

#: aboutbugreportingdialog.cpp:43
msgctxt "@title"
msgid "Information about bug reporting"
msgstr "Informatschonen över't Vermellen vun Fehlers"

#: aboutbugreportingdialog.cpp:45
msgctxt "@info/rich"
msgid "You can help us improve this software by filing a bug report."
msgstr ""
"Du kannst dor bi hölpen, dat de Software beter warrt, wenn Du en "
"Fehlerbericht loosstüerst."

#: aboutbugreportingdialog.cpp:47
msgctxt "@info/rich"
msgid ""
"<note>It is safe to close this dialog. If you do not want to, you do not "
"have to file a bug report.</note>"
msgstr ""
"<note>Du kannst dissen Dialoog ok tomaken. Wenn Du keen Fehlerbericht "
"loosstüern wullt, bruukst Du dat ok nich.</note>"

#: aboutbugreportingdialog.cpp:49
msgctxt "@info/rich"
msgid ""
"In order to generate a useful bug report we need some information about both "
"the crash and your system. (Also, you may need to install some debug "
"packages.)"
msgstr ""
"För en Fehlerbericht, mit den sik ok wat anfangen lett, bruukt wi en poor "
"Informatschonen över den Afstört un över Dien Systeem (un villicht muttst Du "
"ok en poor Fehlersöök-Paketen installeren). "

#: aboutbugreportingdialog.cpp:53
msgctxt "@title"
msgid "Bug Reporting Assistant Steps Guide"
msgstr "De Schreed vun den Fehlerbericht-Hölper"

#: aboutbugreportingdialog.cpp:55
msgctxt "@info/rich"
msgid ""
"This assistant will guide you through the crash reporting process of the KDE "
"Bug Reports Database Site. All the information you enter to the bug report "
"must be in English, if possible, as KDE is developed internationally."
msgstr ""
"Disse Hölper föhrt Di dör dat Opstellen vun en Afstört-Mellen op KDE sien "
"Fehlerberichtdatenbank-Sieden. All Informatschonen, de Du för den "
"Fehlerbericht ingiffst, mööt op Engelsch wesen, denn KDE warrt "
"internatschonaal utwickelt."

#: aboutbugreportingdialog.cpp:61
msgctxt "@title"
msgid "Crash Information"
msgstr "Afstörten-Informatschonen"

#: aboutbugreportingdialog.cpp:63
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info/rich"
msgid ""
"This page will generate a backtrace of the crash. This is information that "
"tells the developers where the application crashed. If the crash information "
"is not detailed enough, you may need to install some debug packages and "
"reload it. You can find more information about backtraces, what they mean, "
"and how they are useful at <link>%1</link>"
msgstr ""
"Disse Siet stellt en Fehlerspoor för den Afstört op. Disse Informatschonen "
"vertellt de Programmschrievers, woneem dat Programm afstörten dee. Bargt de "
"Afstörten-Informatschonen nich noog Informatschonen, muttst Du wull en Reeg "
"Fehlersöök-Paketen installeren un ehr nochmaal laden. Mehr Informatschonen "
"över Fehlersporen, wat se bedüden doot un för wat se goot sünd, kannst Du "
"ünner <link>%1</link> nakieken."

#: aboutbugreportingdialog.cpp:69
msgctxt "@info/rich"
msgid ""
"Once you get a useful trace (or if you do not want to install the missing "
"packages) you can continue."
msgstr ""
"Hest Du en bruukbor Fehlerspoor opstellt (oder wenn Du de fehlen Paketen "
"nich installeren wullt), kannst Du wiedermaken."

#: aboutbugreportingdialog.cpp:73
msgctxt "@title"
msgid "What do you know about the crash"
msgstr "Wat Du över den Afstört weten deist"

#: aboutbugreportingdialog.cpp:75
msgctxt "@info/rich"
msgid ""
"In this page you need to answer some questions about the crash context and "
"if you are willing to help the developers in the future if it is needed. "
"This means you will need to open a KDE Bug tracking system account."
msgstr ""
"Op disse Siet warrst Du fraagt över den Kontext vun den Afstört un wat Du de "
"Programmschrievers in de Tokunft hölpen wullt, wenn dat noot deit. Dat "
"bedüüdt, Du muttst en Konto för KDE sien Fehlerbericht-Systeem opmaken."

#: aboutbugreportingdialog.cpp:79
msgctxt "@info/rich"
msgid ""
"If you can, describe the crash context, the details of what you were doing "
"when the application crashed. You can mention: documents that you were using "
"(and their type/format), actions you were taking in or outside the "
"application, web sites you were browsing, other strange things you noticed "
"before or after the crash, and so on."
msgstr ""
"Wenn Du kannst, giff hier bitte den Kontext vun den Afstört an, un wat Du "
"jüst bi weerst to doon, as dat Programm afstörten dee. Du kannst ok dit "
"angeven: Dokmenten, de du bruukt hest (un ehr Typ/Formaat), Saken, de Du "
"binnen oder buten dat Programm maakt hest, Nettsieden, de Du ankeken hest, "
"anner snaaksch Sakens, de vör- oder achteran den Afstört passeren un so "
"wieder."

#: aboutbugreportingdialog.cpp:87
msgctxt "@title"
msgid "Conclusions"
msgstr "Resultaat"

#: aboutbugreportingdialog.cpp:89
msgctxt "@info/rich"
msgid ""
"Using the quality of the crash information gathered previously, and your "
"answers on the previous page, the assistant will tell you if the crash is "
"worth reporting or not."
msgstr ""
"De Hölper vertellt Di nu mit de Gööd vun de vördem tohoopsammelten "
"Informatschonen un mit Dien Antern op de verleden Siet, wat sik dat lohnt, "
"dat Du den Afstört berichten deist."

#: aboutbugreportingdialog.cpp:92
msgctxt "@info/rich"
msgid ""
"If the crash is worth reporting, and the application is supported in the KDE "
"bug tracking system, you can click <interface>Next</interface>. However if "
"it is not supported you will need to directly contact the maintainer of the "
"application."
msgstr ""
"Lohnt sik dat Berichten, un warrt dat Programm binnen KDE sien Fehlerbericht-"
"Systeem ünnerstütt, kannst Du op <interface>Nakamen</interface> klicken, man "
"warrt dat nich ünnerstütt, muttst Du dat Programm sien Pleger direktemang "
"ansnacken."

#: aboutbugreportingdialog.cpp:96
msgctxt "@info/rich"
msgid ""
"If the crash is listed as being not worth reporting, you can still manually "
"report the bug if you want to."
msgstr ""
"Is dat Resultaat, dat lohnt sik nich, dat Du den Afstört berichten deist, "
"kannst Du dat liekers vun Hand doon, wenn Du dat wullt."

#: aboutbugreportingdialog.cpp:100 drkonqibugreport.cpp:89
msgctxt "@title"
msgid "KDE Bug Tracking System Login"
msgstr "Anmellen bi KDE sien Fehlerbericht-Systeem"

#: aboutbugreportingdialog.cpp:102
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info/rich"
msgid ""
"As we may need to contact you in the future to ask for further information "
"and we need to keep track of the bug reports, you need to have an account on "
"the KDE bug tracking system. If you do not have one, you can create one "
"here: <link>%1</link>"
msgstr ""
"Wi mööt Di in de Tokunft villicht maal ansnacken un na mehr Informatschonen "
"fragen, un wi mööt de Översicht över de Fehlerberichten wohren. Dorüm "
"bruukst Du en Konto för KDE sien Fehlerbericht-Systeem. Hest Du keen, kannst "
"Du hier en opmaken: <link>%1</link>"

#: aboutbugreportingdialog.cpp:107
msgctxt "@info/rich"
msgid ""
"Then you can write your username and password and press the Login button. "
"Once you are authenticated, you can press Next to continue."
msgstr ""
"Denn kannst Du Dien Brukernaam un Passwoort ingeven un op \"Anmellen\" "
"klicken. Is de Identiteetprööv afslaten, kannst Du op \"Nakamen\" klicken."

#: aboutbugreportingdialog.cpp:110
msgctxt "@info/rich"
msgid ""
"The KWallet dialog may appear when pressing Login to save your password in "
"the KWallet password system. Also, it will prompt you for the KWallet "
"password upon loading to autocomplete the data if you use this assistant "
"again."
msgstr ""
"De KWallet-Dialoog mag opduken, wenn Du op \"Anmellen\" klickst. Du kannst "
"Dien Passwoort denn binnen Dien elektroonsche Knipp wohren. Bruukst Du "
"dissen Hölper nochmaal, fraagt KWallet Di na't Passwoort för de Knipp un "
"föögt de Anmelldaten automaatsch in."

#: aboutbugreportingdialog.cpp:116 drkonqibugreport.cpp:98
msgctxt "@title"
msgid "Bug Report Keywords"
msgstr "Fehlerbericht-Slötelwöör"

#: aboutbugreportingdialog.cpp:118
msgctxt "@info/rich"
msgid ""
"In this step you need to write at least four (4) words to identify the "
"crash. You can use the application name, or write a little sentence about "
"the crash or the context. This text will be used to search for similar "
"crashes already reported in the database, to help you and others find them "
"later. Also, this text can be used as the title of the future bug report. "
"You can change this title later."
msgstr ""
"Hier muttst Du tominnst veer Wöör ingeven, mit de sik de Afstört kennen "
"lett. Du kannst den Programmnaam bruken, oder en lütt Satz över den Afstört "
"oder den Kontext ingeven. Mit den Text warrt na anner, liek Afstörten söcht, "
"de dat al binnen de Datenbank gifft, so kannst Du un ok anner Lüüd de beter "
"wedderfinnen. Du kannst den Text ok later as Titel för den Fehlerbericht "
"bruken. Du kannst den Titel later noch ännern."

#: aboutbugreportingdialog.cpp:124 aboutbugreportingdialog.cpp:150
msgctxt "@info/rich"
msgid "<note>You should write in English.</note>"
msgstr "<note>Beacht: Bitte schriev op Engelsch!</note>"

#: aboutbugreportingdialog.cpp:127
msgctxt "@title"
msgid "Bug Report Possible Duplicate list"
msgstr "Möögliche Dubbels för den Fehlerbericht"

#: aboutbugreportingdialog.cpp:130
msgctxt "@info/rich"
msgid "This is an optional step."
msgstr "Disse Schreed is köörfree."

#: aboutbugreportingdialog.cpp:131
msgctxt "@info/rich"
msgid ""
"This page will search the bug report database for similar crashes which are "
"possibly duplicates of your bug. If there are similar bug reports found, you "
"can double click on them to show their details. Then, read the current bug "
"report information so you can check if the situations are similar and you "
"can tentatively mark your crash as a duplicate of that report."
msgstr ""
"Op disse Siet warrt binnen de Fehlerbericht-Datenbank na möögliche Dubbels "
"för Dien Fehler söcht. Gifft dat liek Fehlerberichten, kannst Du dor op "
"dubbelklicken un so de Enkelheiten wiesen. Denn prööv bitte, wat de Ümstänn "
"liek sünd, un mark Dien Afstört eerstmaal as en Dubbel vun den Bericht, wenn "
"dat so is."

#: aboutbugreportingdialog.cpp:137
msgctxt "@info/rich"
msgid ""
"If not enough possible duplicates are found, or you did not find a similar "
"report, then you can force the search for more bug reports (only if the date "
"range is not reached.)"
msgstr ""
"Gifft dat nich noog Dubbels, oder hest Du keen liek Bericht funnen, kannst "
"Du dat Söken na mehr Fehlerberichten verdwingen (bloots wenn Du nich al bi "
"de Datumgrenz anlangt büst)."

#: aboutbugreportingdialog.cpp:140
msgctxt "@info/rich"
msgid ""
"Do not worry if you cannot find a similar bug report or you do not know what "
"to look at. The bug report database maintainers will look at it later. It is "
"better to file a duplicate then to not file at all."
msgstr ""
"Maak Di man keen Kopp, wenn Du keen liek Fehlerbericht finnen kannst, oder "
"Du nich weetst, na wat Du kieken schallst. De Plegers vun de Fehlerbericht-"
"Datenbank kiekt sik dat denn later an. Dat is beter, Du vermellst en Dubbel, "
"as dat Du gor nix berichten deist."

#: aboutbugreportingdialog.cpp:146
msgctxt "@title"
msgid "Details of the Bug report"
msgstr "Enkelheiten vun den Fehlerbericht"

#: aboutbugreportingdialog.cpp:148
msgctxt "@info/rich"
msgid ""
"In this case you need to write a title and description of the crash context. "
"Explain as best you can."
msgstr ""
"Giff bitte en Titel un en Beschrieven vun den Afstört sien Kontext in. "
"Verkloor dat so goot as Du man bloots kannst."

#: aboutbugreportingdialog.cpp:153 drkonqibugreport.cpp:124
msgctxt "@title"
msgid "Send Crash Report"
msgstr "Afstörtbericht loosstüern"

#: aboutbugreportingdialog.cpp:155
msgctxt "@info/rich"
msgid ""
"This page will send the bug report to the bug tracking system and it will "
"notify you when it is done. Then, it will show the URL of the bug report in "
"the KDE bug tracking system, so that you can look at the report later."
msgstr ""
"Op disse Siet warrt de Fehlerbericht dat Fehlerbericht-Systeem tostüert, Du "
"kriggst denn Bescheed, wenn dat afslaten is. Achteran warrt de URL vun den "
"Fehlerbericht binnen KDE sien Fehlerbericht-Systeem wiest, so dat Du em "
"later wedderfinnen kannst."

#: aboutbugreportingdialog.cpp:159
msgctxt "@info/rich"
msgid ""
"If the process fails, you can click <interface>Retry</interface> to try "
"sending the bug report again."
msgstr ""
"Sleiht dat Loosstüern fehl, kannst Du op <interface>Nochmaal versöken</"
"interface> klicken, wenn Du dat nochmaal proberen wullt."

#: bugzillalib.cpp:112
msgctxt "@info"
msgid "Unknown response from the server"
msgstr "Nich begäng Anter vun Server"

#: bugzillalib.cpp:146
msgctxt "@info"
msgid "Invalid bug report: corrupted data"
msgstr "Leeg Fehlerbericht: schaadhaftig Daten"

#: bugzillalib.cpp:191
msgctxt "@info"
msgid "Invalid bug list: corrupted data"
msgstr "Leeg Fehlerlist: schaadhaftig Daten"

#: bugzillalib.cpp:262
msgctxt "@info"
msgid "Unknown error"
msgstr "Nich begäng Fehler"

#: drkonqi.cpp:186
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid "Report saved to <filename>%1</filename>."
msgstr "Bericht na <filename>%1</filename> sekert."

#: drkonqi.cpp:189
msgctxt "@info"
msgid "Could not create a file in which to save the report."
msgstr "Datei, binnen de de Bericht sekert warrt, lett sik nich opstellen."

#: drkonqi.cpp:200
msgctxt "@title:window"
msgid "Select Filename"
msgstr "Dateinaam utsöken"

#: drkonqi.cpp:214
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid "Cannot open file <filename>%1</filename> for writing."
msgstr "De Datei <filename>%1</filename> lett sik nich schrieven."

#: drkonqiassistantpages_base.cpp:89
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"The crash information is not useful enough, do you want to try to improve it?"
msgstr ""
"De Afstört-Informatschonen sünd so nich recht för wat to bruken. Wullt Du "
"dat verbetern?"

#: drkonqiassistantpages_base.cpp:91
msgctxt "@title:window"
msgid "Crash Information is not useful enough"
msgstr "Afstört-Informatschonen laat sik nich recht bruken"

#: drkonqiassistantpages_base.cpp:133
msgctxt "@action:button"
msgid "Sho&w Report Information"
msgstr "Bericht-Informatschonen &wiesen"

#: drkonqiassistantpages_base.cpp:135
msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid ""
"Use this button to show the generated report information about this crash to "
"a file."
msgstr ""
"Mit dissen Knoop kannst Du den opstellten Bericht över den Afstört ankieken."

#: drkonqiassistantpages_base.cpp:178
msgctxt "@info"
msgid "The automatically generated crash information is very useful."
msgstr ""
"De automaatsch opstellten Afstört-Informatschonen laat sik goot bruken."

#: drkonqiassistantpages_base.cpp:184
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"The automatically generated crash information lacks some details but may be "
"still be useful."
msgstr ""
"De automaatsch opstellten Afstört-Informatschonen fehlt en Reeg Enkelheiten, "
"man laat sik wull liekers bruken."

#: drkonqiassistantpages_base.cpp:191
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"The automatically generated crash information lacks important details and it "
"is probably not very useful."
msgstr ""
"De automaatsch opstellten Afstört-Informatschonen fehlt wichtig Enkelheiten "
"un laat sik wull nich recht bruken."

#: drkonqiassistantpages_base.cpp:201
msgctxt "@info"
msgid "The automatically generated crash information is not useful enough."
msgstr ""
"De automaatsch opstellten Afstört-Informatschonen laat sik nich recht bruken."

#: drkonqiassistantpages_base.cpp:203
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"<note>You can try to improve this by installing some packages and reloading "
"the information on the Crash Information page. You can read the Bug "
"Reporting Guide by clicking on the <interface>Help</interface> button.</note>"
msgstr ""
"<note>Du kannst dit verbetern, wenn Du en Reeg Paketen installeerst un de "
"Informatschonen op de Siet mit Afstört-Informatschonen nieg laadst. Du "
"kannst de Inföhren för't Berichten vun Fehlers lesen, wenn Du op den Knoop "
"<interface>Hülp</interface> klickst.</note>"

#: drkonqiassistantpages_base.cpp:216
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"You can explain in detail what you were doing when the application crashed "
"and the developers can contact you for more information if required."
msgstr ""
"Du kannst all Enkelheiten dor över vertellen, wat Du jüst daan hest, as dat "
"Programm afstörten dee, un de Programmschrievers köönt Di ansnacken, wenn se "
"mehr Informatschonen bruukt."

#: drkonqiassistantpages_base.cpp:220
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"You can explain in detail what you were doing when the application crashed "
"but the developers cannot contact you for more information if required."
msgstr ""
"Du kannst all Enkelheiten dor över vertellen, wat Du jüst daan hest, as dat "
"Programm afstörten dee, un de Programmschrievers mööt Di nich ansnacken, "
"wenn se mehr Informatschonen bruukt."

#: drkonqiassistantpages_base.cpp:226
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"You are not sure what you were doing when the application crashed but the "
"developers can contact you for more information if required."
msgstr ""
"Du weetst nich nau, wat Du jüst daan hest, as dat Programm afstörten dee, "
"man de Programmschrievers köönt Di ansnacken, wenn se mehr Informatschonen "
"bruukt."

#: drkonqiassistantpages_base.cpp:230
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"You are not sure what you were doing when the application crashed and the "
"developers cannot contact you for more information if required."
msgstr ""
"Du weetst nich nau, wat Du jüst daan hest, as dat Programm afstörten dee, un "
"de Programmschrievers mööt Di nich ansnacken, wenn se mehr Informatschonen "
"bruukt."

#: drkonqiassistantpages_base.cpp:241
msgctxt "@info"
msgid "This is considered helpful for the application developers."
msgstr "Dit hölpt de Programmschrievers."

#: drkonqiassistantpages_base.cpp:246
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"This application's bugs are reported to the KDE bug tracking system: click "
"<interface>Next</interface> to start the reporting process. You can manually "
"report at <link>%1</link>"
msgstr ""
"Dit Programm sien Fehlers warrt binnen KDE sien Fehlerbericht-Systeem "
"pleegt: klick op <interface>Nakamen</interface>, wenn Du mit den Bericht "
"anfangen wullt. Du kannst den Fehlerbericht ok vun Hand opstellen: <link>%1</"
"link>"

#: drkonqiassistantpages_base.cpp:255
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"This application is not supported in the KDE bug tracking system. Click "
"<interface>Finish</interface> to report this bug to the application "
"maintainer. Also you can manually report at <link>%1</link>."
msgstr ""
"KDE sien Fehlerbericht-Systeem ünnerstütt dit Programm nich. Klick op "
"<interface>Afsluten</interface>, wenn Du den Fehler dat Programm sien Pleger "
"künnig maken wullt. Du kannst ok vun Hand den Bericht opstellen op <link>%1</"
"link>."

#: drkonqiassistantpages_base.cpp:267
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"This is not considered helpful enough for the application developers and "
"therefore the automated bug reporting process is not enabled for this crash."
msgstr ""
"Dit lett nich, as kunnen de Programmschrievers dor recht wat mit anfangen, "
"dorüm warrt de automaatsche Fehlerbericht för dissen Afstört nich anmaakt."

#: drkonqiassistantpages_base.cpp:270
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"If you change your mind, you can go back and review the assistant questions. "
"Also, you can manually report it on your own if you would like to."
msgstr ""
"Ännerst Du Dien Verscheel, kannst Du torüchgahn un de Fragen överarbeiden. "
"Du kannst den Fehlerbericht ok vun Hand opstellen, wenn Du dat wullt."

#: drkonqiassistantpages_base.cpp:275
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"This application is supported in the KDE bug tracking system. You can "
"manually report this bug at <link>%1</link>. Click <interface>Finish</"
"interface> to close the assistant."
msgstr ""
"KDE sien Fehlerbericht-Systeem ünnerstütt dit Programm. Du kannst dissen "
"Fehler vun Hand op <link>%1</link> berichten. Klick op <interface>Afsluten</"
"interface>, wenn Du den Hölper tomaken wullt."

#: drkonqiassistantpages_base.cpp:282
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"This application is not supported in the KDE bug tracking system. You can "
"manually report this bug to its maintainer at <link>%1</link>. Click "
"<interface>Finish</interface> to close the assistant."
msgstr ""
"KDE sien Fehlerbericht-Systeem deit dit Programm nich ünnerstütten. Du "
"kannst sien Pleger dissen Fehler vun Hand op <link>%1</link> berichten. "
"Klick op <interface>Afsluten</interface>, wenn Du den Hölper tomaken wullt."

#: drkonqiassistantpages_base.cpp:299
msgctxt "@title:window"
msgid "Report Information"
msgstr "Bericht-Informatschonen"

#: drkonqiassistantpages_base.cpp:305 getbacktracewidget.cpp:61
msgctxt "@action:button"
msgid "&Save to File"
msgstr "As Datei &sekern"

#: drkonqiassistantpages_base.cpp:307
msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid ""
"Use this button to save the generated report information about this crash to "
"a file. You can use this option to report the bug later."
msgstr ""
"Mit dissen Knoop kannst Du den opstellten Bericht över den Afstört as Datei "
"sekern. Du kannst so den Fehler later künnig maken."

#: drkonqiassistantpages_base.cpp:321
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info/plain"
msgid "Report to %1"
msgstr ""

#: drkonqiassistantpages_bugzilla.cpp:53
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info:status '1' is replaced with \"bugs.kde.org\""
msgid "You need to login with your %1 account in order to proceed."
msgstr ""

#: drkonqiassistantpages_bugzilla.cpp:56
msgctxt "@action:button"
msgid "Login"
msgstr "Anmellen"

#: drkonqiassistantpages_bugzilla.cpp:58
msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid ""
"Use this button to login to the KDE bug tracking system using the provided "
"username and password."
msgstr ""

#: drkonqiassistantpages_bugzilla.cpp:67
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info/rich"
msgid ""
"<note>You need a user account on the <link url='%1'>KDE bug tracking system</"
"link> in order to file a bug report, because we may need to contact you "
"later for requesting further information. <nl />If you do not have one, you "
"can freely <link url='%2'>create one here</link>.</note>"
msgstr ""

#: drkonqiassistantpages_bugzilla.cpp:84
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info:status"
